(7748335, 1279740, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like the scene and perspective, but the light isn''t flattering and the blank cloudless sky grabs my eye. In such cases, I will apply a slight vignette to it and that helps add some interest to an empty sky.</td>', 'I like the scene and perspective, but the light isn''t flattering and the blank cloudless sky grabs my eye. In such cases, I will apply a slight vignette to it and that helps add some interest to an empty sky.', '2023-06-07 01:33:44.000000', NULL, 1),
