(7748391, 1279513, 100393, '<td valign="top">I''m puzzled by this image, the control of the light, the smoothness and to an extend the line and smoothness of the form. Is this a model shot or a shot of a statue.<br/> <br/>Either way, the shot is spectacular - I''d like to think its a live model shot but there is something statuesque about the form.<br/> <br/>Nonetheless, I feel compelled to give the image a 10.</td>', 'I''m puzzled by this image, the control of the light, the smoothness and to an extend the line and smoothness of the form. Is this a model shot or a shot of a statue. Either way, the shot is spectacular - I''d like to think its a live model shot but there is something statuesque about the form. Nonetheless, I feel compelled to give the image a 10.', '2023-06-07 09:12:46.000000', NULL, 1),
