(7749240, 1279309, 83313, '<td valign="top">Fantastic work, but the long exposures in the sky and on the road are fighting it out to be the main subject of my attention.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2023-06-14 00:41:00.</i></td>', 'Fantastic work, but the long exposures in the sky and on the road are fighting it out to be the main subject of my attention.', '2023-06-11 19:00:23.000000', '2023-06-14 01:41:00.000000', 1),
