(7749242, 1279324, 83313, '<td valign="top">I think I''ve been here, but without a drone. La Jolla beach? I''m surprised you got away with flying a drone here.</td>', 'I think I''ve been here, but without a drone. La Jolla beach? I''m surprised you got away with flying a drone here.', '2023-06-11 19:03:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749243, 1279815, 83313, '<td valign="top">Good old Millenium Park always produces strong images. Especially with a drone!</td>', 'Good old Millenium Park always produces strong images. Especially with a drone!', '2023-06-11 19:04:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749297, 1279324, 30861, '<td valign="top">Lev, I remember when there weren''t any seals here, and my parents took me there to learn to swim in Salt Water. At the time my Grandma Jessie had one of those old houses right by this cove. The funny thing is, the entire cove is artificial: Helen Browning Scripps had it built and gifted it to the people of La Jolla so the children would have somewhere sheltered to swim. Sadly, not anymore :-(</td>', 'Lev, I remember when there weren''t any seals here, and my parents took me there to learn to swim in Salt Water. At the time my Grandma Jessie had one of those old houses right by this cove. The funny thing is, the entire cove is artificial: Helen Browning Scripps had it built and gifted it to the people of La Jolla so the children would have somewhere sheltered to swim. Sadly, not anymore :-(', '2023-06-11 23:46:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749392, 1279990, 42733, '<td valign="top">My favorite in this challenge.</td>', 'My favorite in this challenge.', '2023-06-12 07:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
