(7749673, 1280148, 83313, '<td valign="top">I like it. One minor nitpick though. An image like this accentuates any minor lack of alignment of the image to the border. The straight lines of the green board with blue stripe on the right are sticking out to me as not perfectly squared up with the edge of the frame. Like I said, very minor, but it is an OCD actuator, like a hanging frame on the wall that isn''t straight.</td>', 'I like it. One minor nitpick though. An image like this accentuates any minor lack of alignment of the image to the border. The straight lines of the green board with blue stripe on the right are sticking out to me as not perfectly squared up with the edge of the frame. Like I said, very minor, but it is an OCD actuator, like a hanging frame on the wall that isn''t straight.', '2023-06-13 13:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749675, 1279652, 83313, '<td valign="top">Pleasing textures on this.</td>', 'Pleasing textures on this.', '2023-06-13 13:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749676, 1279217, 83313, '<td valign="top">The tunnel under O''hare, I think? I''ve never been happy with the shots I''ve attempted to get of this location.</td>', 'The tunnel under O''hare, I think? I''ve never been happy with the shots I''ve attempted to get of this location.', '2023-06-13 13:20:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(7749681, 1280130, 83313, '<td valign="top">Looks like the chapel in downtown Dallas. Always makes an interesting shot. The shadow areas of grey concrete have a lot of magenta toned noise showing and I expect that may hold this one back a little. (Or maybe I''m just a nitpicker.) I have a night shot of the outside I took many years ago that is a favorite, though it just did ok with the DPC collective. I suspect 12 years later, I can probably improve on it.<br/><a href="https://www.dpchallenge.com/image.php?IMAGE_ID=937597" rel="nofollow" target="_blank"><img border="0" src="https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1339/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_937597.jpg" xalt="'' . substr(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1339/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_937597.jpg'', strrpos(''https://images.dpchallenge.com/images_challenge/1000-1999/1339/120/Copyrighted_Image_Reuse_Prohibited_937597.jpg'', ''/'') + 1) . ''"/></a></td>', 'Looks like the chapel in downtown Dallas. Always makes an interesting shot. The shadow areas of grey concrete have a lot of magenta toned noise showing and I expect that may hold this one back a little. (Or maybe I''m just a nitpicker.) I have a night shot of the outside I took many years ago that is a favorite, though it just did ok with the DPC collective. I suspect 12 years later, I can probably improve on it.', '2023-06-13 14:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
